#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_admin_nuke.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Factory reset the entire system. Destroys all data (users, channels, messages, preferences, bots, P2P sessions) except admin roles, audit logs, server bans, and server settings. The registration setting is reopened so an admin nick can be recreated. Requires server administrator role. The Admin Console Danger Zone tab requires typing the server name before execution."
msgstr "— 將整個系統恢復原廠設定。會銷毀所有資料（使用者、頻道、訊息、偏好設定、機器人、P2P 工作階段），但管理員角色、稽核紀錄、伺服器封鎖和伺服器設定除外。註冊設定會重新開放，以便重新建立管理員暱稱。需要伺服器管理員角色。管理主控台的「危險區」分頁在執行前需要輸入伺服器名稱。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_admin_nuke.html.heex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Server configuration; registration is reset to open"
msgstr "— 伺服器設定；註冊會重設為開放"

