#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_p2p.html.heex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "P2P Sessions in Chat"
msgstr "P2P 聊天對話"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_p2p.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "P2P Starting Room"
msgstr "P2P 起始聊天室"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_p2p.html.heex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "You can hold sessions with several people at once. Only a second session with the same person is refused."
msgstr "你可以同時和好幾個人進行工作階段。只有與同一個人的第二個工作階段會被拒絕。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_p2p.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "creates the session and writes the request straight into your private message with that person. Nothing is asked of you first. The line carries the session's own address and draws a card, and that card is the door for both of you — the other side opens the same one, or presses Decline beside it. Following it opens the session in a browser tab of its own, starting in the room where you both pick devices and press Ready. Once the host presses Start, Call, Files, Games and Stats all run over the one connection; ending one keeps the others alive."
msgstr "會建立工作階段，並把請求直接寫進你與那個人的私訊裡。事先不會問你任何事。那一行帶著工作階段自己的位址並畫出一張卡片，而這張卡片是你們兩人的門——對方開啟的是同一扇，或者按下它旁邊的「拒絕」。點開它會在自己的瀏覽器分頁裡開啟工作階段，先進入那個房間，兩個人在那裡各自挑選裝置並按下「就緒」。房主一按「開始」，通話、檔案、遊戲和統計就都在同一條連線上執行；結束其中一項，其他項照樣運作。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_list.html.heex:25
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A registered channel stays in the list even when everybody has left it. Such a room shows no user count and says instead when it was last used, so an empty row means quiet rather than gone. Joining one brings it back up exactly like any other channel."
msgstr "已註冊的頻道即使所有人都離開了，也會留在清單裡。這樣的聊天室不顯示人數，而是顯示最近一次使用的時間，所以空行的意思是安靜，而不是消失。加入它就會像其他頻道一樣重新活躍起來。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_list.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Rooms With Nobody In Them"
msgstr "沒有人的聊天室"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_event.html.heex:60
