#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "/event cancel 12"
msgstr "/event cancel 12"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_event.html.heex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A channel holds up to 50 events at once"
msgstr "一個頻道同時最多可有 50 個活動"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_event.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A channel that only exists while somebody happens to be typing has no next time. An event is the next time, written down where the whole room can see it — and everyone who says they are coming is reminded before it starts."
msgstr "只在有人恰好打字時才存在的頻道，是沒有下一次的。活動就是那個下一次，寫在整個聊天室都看得到的地方——而說要參加的人會在開始前收到提醒。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_event.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A reminder goes out once, and never for something already under way"
msgstr "提醒只發一次，且絕不會為已經開始的活動發出"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_event.html.heex:41
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Calling one off keeps the record that it was going to happen"
msgstr "取消活動後，仍會保留它原本預定舉行的紀錄"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_event.html.heex:58
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Channel Events"
msgstr "頻道活動"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_event.html.heex:30
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Channel operators and owners schedule; anybody in the channel can say they are going. An event is called off by whoever scheduled it, or by an operator."
msgstr "由頻道管理員和擁有者安排；頻道裡的任何人都可以表示參加。活動可由安排者或管理員取消。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_event.html.heex:63
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Notifications When the App Is Closed"
msgstr "應用程式關閉時的通知"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_event.html.heex:39
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Saying you are going twice is saying it once"
msgstr "說兩次參加等於說一次"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_event.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The channel gets a line with a card under it showing the start in each reader's own time zone and a button to say you are going. Shortly before it starts the room is told again, and everybody who said yes gets a notification through whatever they already have switched on. With no arguments at all, the command opens the Events window instead."
msgstr "頻道會收到一行訊息，下方附有一張卡片，依每位讀者所在的時區顯示開始時間，並附有一個表示參加的按鈕。開始前不久，聊天室會再收到一次提醒，所有表示參加的人都會透過他們已開啟的方式收到通知。完全不帶參數時，該指令會改為開啟活動視窗。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_event.html.heex:37
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The start has to be later than now"
msgstr "開始時間必須晚於現在"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_event.html.heex:19
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Calls off the event with that number."
msgstr "— 取消該編號的活動。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_event.html.heex:12
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— How long from now it starts: 30m, 2h, 3d. A delay rather than a clock reading, so it means the same instant for everybody."
msgstr "— 距離開始還有多久：30m、2h、3d。這是時長而不是時鐘時間，所以對所有人都是同一個時刻。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_event.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— What the channel is going to do. Up to 120 characters."
msgstr "— 頻道要做的事。最多 120 個字元。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_notice_routing.html.heex:21
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "). Routing is fixed to the active window. Running"
msgstr "）。通知固定導向目前的活動視窗。執行"

